### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

### Поиск рейсов на дату
GET http://localhost:8080/flights?origin=SVO&destination=LED&date=2026-04-01
Accept: application/json

### Поиск рейсов без фильтра по дате
GET http://localhost:8080/flights?origin=SVO&destination=LED
Accept: application/json

### Получение тестового рейса
GET http://localhost:8080/flights/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Создание бронирования
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "flight_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "passenger_name": "Ivan Petrov",
  "passenger_email": "ivan@example.com",
  "seat_count": 2
}

> {% client.global.set("booking_id", response.body.id); %}

### Получение созданного бронирования
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/{{booking_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Список бронирований пользователя
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings?user_id=aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Accept: application/json

### Отмена созданного бронирования
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Проверка 404
GET http://localhost:8080/flights/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Accept: application/json

### Проверка валидации: отсутствует destination
GET http://localhost:8080/flights?origin=SVO
Accept: application/json
